><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"codec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avc1.64001e\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"target_kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"measured_peak_kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2098</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"measured_avg_kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1611</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"v432\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"w\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">432</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"fps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"codec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"avc1.640015\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"target_kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"measured_peak_kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1157</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"measured_avg_kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">902</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"audio\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"codec\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mp4a.40.2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"kbps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"channels\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份结构化记录的价值在于它把&quot;阶梯&quot;从一段命令行变成了可审计、可对比、可回滚的数据。<code>ladder_version</code> 与 <a href=\"../processing-pipeline/object-storage-key-lifecycle\">对象存储键设计与生命周期</a> 里的版本标识配合，使一次阶梯调优可以灰度到部分流量。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用实测指标替代主观判断\">用实测指标替代主观判断</h3><p>阶梯调优必须闭环。质量侧用感知指标度量：VMAF 是 Netflix 提出的&quot;基于多方法融合的感知视频质量评估算法&quot;，其 <code>libvmaf</code> 实现同时内置 PSNR、PSNR-HVS、SSIM、MS-SSIM 与 CIEDE2000（<a href=\"https://github.com/Netflix/vmaf\">VMAF 项目</a>）。对每一档，做法是抽取若干典型片段、算出该档对源的质量得分，画出&quot;码率—得分&quot;曲线，再检查相邻档之间的得分落差是否落在可接受区间。若某一档的得分与前档几乎相同，说明该档冗余可以删掉；若落差过大，说明中间缺档。### 音频档位的常见错误</p>\n<p>音频经常被当成&quot;配一个 128 kbps AAC 就完事&quot;，但它有一个容易踩的坑：<strong>不同视频档共用同一个音频档时，音频片段的时间边界必须与视频片段一致</strong>，否则播放器在切档时音频会错位。做法是把音频单独编码一次、在 master 清单里作为独立 rendition 被所有视频档引用，而不是每档各编一份音频。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阶梯质量取决于<strong>相邻档的观感落差</strong>，经验码率比约 1.6–1.8 倍；低分辨率下限受内容可读性约束（电商场景不宜低于 432p 一档）。</li>\n<li>帧率是档位的一部分；低档降帧往往比降分辨率更划算。</li>\n<li><strong>所有档的 GOP 与分片边界必须落在同一时间网格</strong>：用统一的 <code>force_key_frames</code> 表达式 + <code>sc_threshold 0</code> + closed GOP，而不是每档自算。</li>\n<li>VOD 用受约束 VBR；清单里的 <code>BANDWIDTH</code> 必须是实测峰值而非目标值，<code>AVERAGE-BANDWIDTH</code> 才是平均值。</li>\n<li>阶梯调优要靠实测质量指标闭环（VMAF/SSIM 曲线），音频作为共享 rendition 单独编码以保证边界一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>阶梯定好之后，下一步是把它切成播放器可以按需请求的片段并生成清单，见 <a href=\"hls-dash-segment-pack\">HLS/DASH 切片与打包</a>。而&quot;哪些档位该被生成&quot;这个决策的代价评估，需要在 <a href=\"../processing-pipeline/async-job-queue-dag\">异步任务队列与衍生 DAG</a> 里按扇出成本核算。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"转码与多码率（bitrate ladder）","id":"转码与多码率-bitrate-ladder"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"为什么自适应必须有多个表述","id":"为什么自适应必须有多个表述"},{"level":3,"text":"阶梯必须与内容复杂度耦合","id":"阶梯必须与内容复杂度耦合"},{"level":2,"text":"阶梯的档位设计与对齐约束","id":"阶梯的档位设计与对齐约束"},{"level":3,"text":"读阶梯表的三个要点","id":"读阶梯表的三个要点"},{"level":3,"text":"帧率也是档位的一部分","id":"帧率也是档位的一部分"},{"level":3,"text":"GOP 必须跨档对齐","id":"gop-必须跨档对齐"},{"level":3,"text":"这道命令为什么这样写","id":"这道命令为什么这样写"},{"level":2,"text":"码率控制模式与质量目标","id":"码率控制模式与质量目标"},{"level":3,"text":"三种码率控制模式","id":"三种码率控制模式"},{"level":3,"text":"声明码率必须与实测码率校验","id":"声明码率必须与实测码率校验"},{"level":3,"text":"用实测指标替代主观判断","id":"用实测指标替代主观判断"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"水印与品牌视觉规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/media-asset-processing-service/image-transform/watermark-brand-rule"},"next":{"title":"HLS/DASH 切片与打包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/media-asset-processing-service/video-transcode/hls-dash-segment-pack"}}